<h3><u>Ye musalmano rasool e paak</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Ya husain, ya husain..(3)</p>

<p>Ye musalmano rasool e paak ka farmaan hai..(4)<br />
Tumme chhode jaa raha hu..(2)<br />
Aal aur Qur&#39;an hai</p>

<p>1. Khoob hai ajre risalat mustafa ko mil raha..(2)<br />
qatl sayyed ho rahe hai..(2)<br />
jal raha qur&#39;an hai</p>

<p>2. Jiske lab harkat nahi karte wo hai amre khuda..(2)<br />
Kis tarha ye keh diya..(2)<br />
tune use hizyaan hai</p>

<p>Mai aksar sochta rehta hu, har roz guzar yu jaae..(2)<br />
Kya dushmani thi..(2)<br />
Banu hashim se<br />
Logo ki koi batlaaye<br />
Jo waaste dono..(2)<br />
Aalam ke, hai rahmat banke aaye<br />
Kya uski aal ki..(2)<br />
Khatir hai, zindaan gaye banwaye</p>

<p>3. Dono alam ke liye jo baise rahmat bana..(2)<br />
kya usi ki aal ke hi..(2)<br />
waaste zindaan hai</p>

<p>4. Deen e ahmad ki baqa ki waaste waiz bata..(2)<br />
juz nabi ki aal ke..(2)<br />
kiska hua nuksaan hai</p>

<p>Qanoon e mashiyat ka shanasa aisa..(2)<br />
kausar ho jo qadmo me to pyasa aisa<br />
Dekh kar fakhr se kehte the rasoole saqlain<br />
taqdeer se milta hai nawasa aisa</p>

<p>5. Al husaino minni se ye saaf zahir hogaya..(2)<br />
ke husain ibn e ali me..(2)<br />
mustafa ki jaan hai</p>

<p>6. Ye nishaa matam ke, dil me ghum ali ke laal ka..(2)<br />
apni bakhshish ka hamare..(2)<br />
paas ye samaan hai</p>

<p>7. Naam usi hasti ke hai ye aajka nauha ameer..(2)<br />
jo ajal se ambiya ka..(2)<br />
momino sultaan hai</p>
</p>